# Standard Library — Math (MASTER_DOCUMENT.md §32.1)
# randomInt() — a random whole number in an inclusive range.

say "Rolling a six-sided die 5 times:"
repeat 5 as i
    say randomInt(1, 6)
end repeat

hold low = 10
hold high = 20
say "A random number between", low, "and", high, ":", randomInt(low, high)
